{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PetMate is a new table pet game designed to create a virtual companion that can actually interact with you. Unlike traditional desktop cartoon images, PetMate is not just a static virtual character, it can talk to you and has the ability to communicate visually, audibly and emotionally, as if it were a real friend. What's more, PetMate is able to memorize your memories and become your exclusive companion, adding a unique emotional connection with every interaction.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657100?t=1745293060","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657100?t=1745293060","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657100/9e67135e6ac1c9168a84b48cc65f20d6e054dbe2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745293060","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657100/9e67135e6ac1c9168a84b48cc65f20d6e054dbe2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745293060","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PetMate is a new table pet game designed to create a virtual companion that can actually interact with you. Unlike traditional desktop cartoon images, PetMate is not just a static virtual character, it can talk to you and has the ability to communicate visually, audibly and emotionally, as if it were a real friend. What's more, PetMate is able to memorize your memories and become your exclusive companion, adding a unique emotional connection with every interaction.</p>","developers":["Mater Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"he